# Language

- **User chat**: respond to the user in Russian.
- **Everything in the repo**: English only — UI copy, README, comments, commit messages, variable names, docs, error messages, aria-labels.
- **Formatting**: use `en-US` locale for numbers and dates in the app unless the user explicitly asks for another locale.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — UI in English
<StatRow label="Monthly XP" value={`${xp.toLocaleString('en-US')} XP`} />

// ❌ BAD — Russian in source/UI
<StatRow label="Опыт за месяц" value={`${xp.toLocaleString('ru-RU')} XP`} />
```
